---
source: src/ui.rs
expression: "render_sized(&app, 70, 40).backend()"
---
"╭ Home ──────────── Monday, October 5 2026 (today) ──────────────────╮"
"│1.╭ Options ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮  │"
"│  │     Empty notes open ready to type. With this on, they open  │  │"
"│  │     in normal mode, and i starts typing.                     │  │"
"│  │ [ ] Notes with text in insert                                │  │"
"│  │     Notes with text open in normal mode. With this on, they  │  │"
"│  │     open ready to type at the end.                           │  │"
"│  │ Notes editor: Built-in                                       │  │"
"│  │   A command to open notes files with, like nvim. Leave it    │  │"
"│  │   empty for todoro's own editor.                             │  │"
"│  │                                                              │  │"
"│  │ Keys                                                         │  │"
"│  │ Keybindings: unavailable                                     │  │"
"│  │   Your own keys for the list and the leader menu. Enter to   │  │"
"│  │   edit them in your editor; the first time, todoro writes    │  │"
"│  │   the file with every default, commented out.                │  │"
"│  │                                                              │  │"
"│  │ Data                                                         │  │"
"│  │ Todoro folder: ~/todoro                                      │  │"
"│  │   Where every workspace is kept. Enter to move them all to   │  │"
"│  │   another folder.                                            │  │"
"│  │                                                              │  │"
"│  │ Delete                                                       │  │"
"│  │ Delete all items and notes in Home                           │  │"
"│  │   Every day's items, and their notes files. The workspace    │  │"
"│  │   stays, empty.                                              │  │"
"│  │ Delete all notes in Home                                     │  │"
"│  │   Every item's notes, and the notes files. The items stay.   │  │"
"│  │ Delete all notes in every workspace                          │  │"
"│  │   Every item's notes in every workspace, and the notes       │  │"
"│  │   files. The items stay.                                     │  │"
"│  │ Delete all items and notes in every workspace                │  │"
"│  │   Every workspace is emptied of items and notes. The         │  │"
"│  │   workspaces stay.                                           │  │"
"│  │ Reset todoro                                                 │  │"
"│  │   Deletes every workspace and your settings, then starts     │  │"
"│  │   again as if newly installed: choose a folder, then see     │  │"
"│  │   what's new. Other files in the todoro folder stay.         │  │"
"╰──╰─────── j/k move · space toggle · / search · esc close ───────╯──╯"
" OPTIONS   j/k move  space toggle  / search  esc close                "
